{"name": "JUST A GUY :  Online Multiplayer Ragdoll Game", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>JUST A GUY</strong>\u00a0is a fun and colorful physics-based adventure game with ragdoll characters. Alone or with friends, whether you're 7 or 77, explore the worlds, find the secrets, unlock the outfits or create your own fun with the game's physics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"390\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578970/extras/cb2b269d567b4655b925176ce7ecb233.poster.avif?t=1762065830\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578970/extras/cb2b269d567b4655b925176ce7ecb233.webm?t=1762065830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578970/extras/cb2b269d567b4655b925176ce7ecb233.mp4?t=1762065830\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PHYSICS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everything in this game is built around physics. Every character, every object, every vehicle is entirely physics-based. This gives the game a unique feel and creates fun new situations every time you play. Get ready to laugh, especially if you're playing with friends !  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"390\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578970/extras/3f3145db6433cc05ecb7a1f16aa83e24.poster.avif?t=1762065830\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578970/extras/3f3145db6433cc05ecb7a1f16aa83e24.webm?t=1762065830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578970/extras/3f3145db6433cc05ecb7a1f16aa83e24.mp4?t=1762065830\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>EXPLORATION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore all kinds of different small open worlds, from a huge bedroom to an amusement park, a water park or even the moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In each level, you'll find lots of activities to complete to earn cosmetic outfits. There are also plenty of secrets and easter eggs to discover !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"390\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578970/extras/4bc02acc1f7c77abf4c348d529e67b5a.poster.avif?t=1762065830\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578970/extras/4bc02acc1f7c77abf4c348d529e67b5a.webm?t=1762065830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578970/extras/4bc02acc1f7c77abf4c348d529e67b5a.mp4?t=1762065830\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As your character is full of energy, you can run very fast, jump high, climb, punch, grab, throw, drive, glide, slide and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use yours arms to interact with the environment in a logical way. You see this cool car over there ? Just grab the steering wheel and gooooo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"390\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578970/extras/bc00811be924d4c08afe8b3e3ec3443a.poster.avif?t=1762065830\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578970/extras/bc00811be924d4c08afe8b3e3ec3443a.webm?t=1762065830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578970/extras/bc00811be924d4c08afe8b3e3ec3443a.mp4?t=1762065830\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>AGE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Even if this game is designed to be playable by kids (no violence, no sex, no drugs, etc), everyone can play it and have fun ! Grab your controller, call a friend and go to explore a\u00a0 \u00a0level !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with a total of 4 friends</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 different levels to explore (and more to come)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many different activities to complete</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Character customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lots of different vehicles to drive (cars, planes, boats,etc.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Online co-op and offline single player</p></li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "JUST A GUY is an online multiplayer ragdoll game. Play with physics, explore small open worlds, drive vehicles, use fun items and complete objectives to earn new cosmetic outfits!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578970/18efdcf28041a90dec189954dfe9d914cf12af41/header.jpg?t=1762065830", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Physics", "Multiplayer", "Funny", "Comedy", "Sandbox", "Open World"], "developers": "Monky", "publishers": "Monky", "release_date": "2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "1578970", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "12 September 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/Mg8IKAnyp1A", "first_seen": 1757635200.0, "review_rank": 1488}